---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title={'"AI" Reads Human: Human Language Encoding at Machine Speed and the Energy Cost'}
  description={'About: "AI" Reads Human. Software agents exchange data in formats made for people to read. This work in progress defines the extra cost and reports parse time and token counts. Energy is not yet measured.'}
>
  <section class="px-6 md:px-10 pt-16 md:pt-24 pb-20 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <p class="section-label mb-4">Research topic · work in progress · about</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-brand-white tracking-tight">
      "AI" Reads Human: Human Language Encoding at Machine Speed and the Energy Cost
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 font-body text-base text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
      Software agents pass data to each other in formats made for people to read, such as JSON (JavaScript Object Notation), YAML (YAML Ain't Markup Language), Markdown, XML (Extensible Markup Language) and CSV (comma-separated values). This topic names the extra work that causes, defines it with units, and measures two parts of it on a reproducible corpus: parse time and token count. Energy is not yet measured.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-8 glass-card p-6">
      <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[2px] uppercase text-brand-gray mb-3">In plain words</p>
      <ol class="list-decimal pl-5 space-y-2 font-body text-sm text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
        <li>Computers and people often use the same written format. That format is easy for people to read, but the computer has to do extra work to read it back.</li>
        <li>On the test data of the paper, the same records took about 8 times longer to read as JSON (Python's built-in reader), and about 735 times longer as YAML, than as a plain fixed binary layout. Read by an AI model, YAML used about 2.2 times as many tokens as CSV.</li>
        <li>The paper measures time and token counts. A first attempt to measure energy on two laptops found the signal too small to separate from background power, so this page makes no claim about how many joules are saved.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a href="/papers/ai-reads-human/" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-dark bg-brand-amber px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:bg-brand-gold transition-colors">
        Read → /papers/ai-reads-human/
      </a>
      <a href="/pdfs/ai-reads-human.pdf" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-amber border border-brand-amber/40 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:bg-brand-amber/10 transition-colors" download>
        Download PDF
      </a>
      <a href="/living/ai-reads-human/" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-cyan border border-brand-cyan/30 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:bg-brand-cyan/10 transition-colors">
        Charts, data and scripts
      </a>
      <a href="/" class="inline-flex font-mono text-xs text-brand-slate border border-brand-border px-4 py-2.5 rounded-md no-underline hover:text-brand-white transition-colors">
        ← Catalog
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
